# even though its alternative cost is payable (Brainstorm in hand, life to pay); with Duress, a spell, on the stack
# in the same turn, it is offered and counters it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Force of Will
Brainstorm
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Marsh Flats
Duress
Swamp
Swamp x12

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Marsh Flats.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Marsh Flats.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Force of Will.Cast
Bot1.Pass
